# bin/

Primary entry point for the cdsync tool. Contains the thin shell coordinator that resolves the CDSYNC_HOME installation root, sources shared library modules, parses command-line arguments, and dispatches to subcommands under lib/. No business logic lives here.

## Files

- `cdsync` -- main entry point; resolves symlink chain to find installation root, sources lib/*.sh dependencies, dispatches subcommand
